WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,590
Madam, please sit down

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,910
Just enough to help us both stand.

3
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,980
We two have some business to attend to

4
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:25,620
How do I feel about the two of them?

5
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,870
Want to hit someone?

6
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,870
What kind of table should we put together for these two losers?

7
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,870
Not shameful enough

8
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:36,460
It's over

9
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,460
Boy, what do you want to do?

10
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,460
What, look at your expression

11
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,460
Very unconvinced

12
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
who are you

13
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,980
You don't want to suppress me

14
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:51,380
I'm coming

15
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:55,740
little god

16
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,130
I don't have a good temper

17
00:00:58,130 --> 00:01:00,770
Is what this Holy Son said wrong?

18
00:01:00,770 --> 00:01:02,770
I can suppress you with one hand
